Dependencies
------------

CoAna does not bundle its dependencies; each is installed separately under its
own license. Required: NumPy, SciPy, pandas, joblib, ipywidgets and NetworkX
(BSD-style), Matplotlib (Matplotlib license, PSF-based), openpyxl and plotly
(MIT). Optional: MDAnalysis (packaged under LGPL-3.0-or-later), pytest (MIT).
